2026-06-02 David Allsopp <dra27 -at- dra27.uk>
  Version 1.0.1
* Fix non-portability use of paste in write-config.sh

2026-06-01 David Allsopp <dra27 -at- dra27.uk>
  Version 1.0.0
* New write-config.sh script for producing opam .config files. Allows variables
  and file-depends to be specified as a command line, while handling both the
  production of checksums and escaping of values.
* Switch the packaging model from one monolithic mingw-w64-shims package such
  that each individual package creates its own shims. In particular, following
  downstream fixes in opam repository, it means that installing shims one-by-one
  no longer causes a recompilation of all packages in the switch.

2024-06-19 David Allsopp <david.allsopp -at- metastack.com>
  Version 0.2.0
* Shim pkgconf.exe if conf-pkg-config is installed (allows dune-configurator to
  access it from outside of a package installation).
* Create shim executables for any non-PATH installation of Cygwin. In
  particular, this allows ocaml/setup-ocaml@v3 to function correctly (it uses
  `--cygwin-location` so that Cygwin is stored separately from the opam root).

2024-03-11 David Allsopp <david.allsopp -at- metastack.com>
  Version 0.1.0
* Initial release.
